WEBVTT

00:13:00.484 --> 00:13:01.693
And guess what?

00:13:02.152 --> 00:13:04.738
We are all doing the same thing
with our planet.

00:13:05.322 --> 00:13:07.407
We are throwing it away,

00:13:07.449 --> 00:13:09.326
we are trashing it.

00:13:09.326 --> 00:13:10.577
Maybe only for a while,

00:13:10.619 --> 00:13:12.329
because we didn't know any better.

00:13:13.121 --> 00:13:17.626
Just to realize how much
we all need the Earth

00:13:17.668 --> 00:13:23.924
because it uniquely contributes
to our lives, and it sustains us.

00:13:26.844 --> 00:13:30.722
A healthier relationship is key.